BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lesvos-petra-feast-of-panagia-glykofilousa-petra-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Feast of Panagia Glykofilousa\, Petra
LOCATION:Petra\, Lesvos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Petra's landmark church sits on a 40 m rock in the middle of the village\, reached by 114 steps\; on the eve and day of the Dormition it fills with pilgrims and the village below with tavernas and music. Petra also keeps the 'Enniamera' (22-23 August) at the Faneromeni chapel. Combine with the beach and the Molyvos road\; parking in Petra on the 15th is hopeless\, so come early.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lesvos/#petra-feast-of-panagia-glykofilousa-petra
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lesvos/#petra-feast-of-panagia-glykofilousa-petra
END:VEVENT
